 States and France. It achieved impressive technological and architectural feats, such as the empire-wide construction of aqueducts and roads, as well as more grandiose monuments and facilities. | Roman sculpture - Wikipedia: Sculpture played a central role in Roman public life; it depicted deities for worship, commemorated the political elite, celebrated historical events, and honored the dead. | Find and save ideas about famous roman statues on Pinterest.: 10 Roman Statues That Capture Myth, History, and Art.
